<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC16.017 Modified Kite Barion</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Steele, Norman W; Seattle F Design, Nov 92, p1</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Uses shape of "The Grace" cut.  Applies half moon</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">facet to level the girdle.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 2.420</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">37 facets + 5 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">1-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.139  T/W = 0.563  U/W = 0.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.576 C/W = 0.137</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.225</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="410">pc16017.asc</tspan>
</text>
